== Trivia ==
<!-- *"Alixer" is a play on the word "Elixir" which means "Magical Potion". -->
*Although '''Alixer'''{{'}}s potions last for 1 hour, players can replenish the potion every 5 minutes.
*As mentioned in their Abiphone dialogue, '''Alixer''' splashes the potions faster if called via Abiphone.

